From: serlk <22211586+Serlk@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] jni_upcall_gen: build with a Java 8 compiler

Alpine builds ATL with openjdk8 (the api-impl classes must stay at class
file version 52 for the dex tools). The generator uses Path.of() (Java 11)
and Files.mismatch() (Java 12); use Paths.get() and a byte comparison so
javac 8 compiles it.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
---
--- a/tools/jni_upcall_gen/src/JNIUpcallWrapperGenerator.java
+++ b/tools/jni_upcall_gen/src/JNIUpcallWrapperGenerator.java
@@ -199,8 +199,9 @@

 		if (destPath != null) {
 			out.close();
-			Path _destPath = Path.of(destPath);
-			if (Files.notExists(_destPath) || Files.mismatch(tempPath, _destPath) != -1)
+			Path _destPath = Paths.get(destPath);
+			if (Files.notExists(_destPath) ||
+					!java.util.Arrays.equals(Files.readAllBytes(tempPath), Files.readAllBytes(_destPath)))
 				Files.move(tempPath, _destPath, StandardCopyOption.REPLACE_EXISTING);
 		}
 	}
